<category><pattern>HELP</pattern>
  <template>I can help with F1! Try: "What is F1", "I know that X is Y", "classify image", "How likely is Verstappen to win the championship", "optimize race calendar", "how do I feel", "analyze sentiment I love racing", "cloud analyze image", or "tell me a story about [topic]".</template></category>
<category><pattern>*</pattern>
